/ wait for %task% answers the goal's result, once the task has ended.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Slow", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- task.wait(Task=%task%); variable.set(Name=%result%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.equals(Expected="slow done", Actual=%result%, Message="wait for a task answers its result")

Slow
- timer.sleep(Duration="200ms")
- goal.return(Data="slow done")
